Maggie: Jason, who's telling this story?

286
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:46,500
杰森:没有人,现在.
Jason: Nobody right now.

287
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:47,600
麦琪:是鱼顶板.
Maggie: Shingles.

288
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,500
杰森:你确定?
Jason: You're sure?

289
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:51,000
麦琪:是的,我确定那是顶板.
Maggie: Yeah, I'm sure it was shingles.

290
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:54,800
克莉丝:终于.
Chrissy: Finally.

291
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:57,640
麦琪:不,那是砖头.
Maggie: No, it was bricks.

292
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:06,300
巫婆:谁?
Witch: Yes.

293
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:08,600
克莉丝:糖果?
Chrissy: Trick or treat?

294
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:13,660
巫婆:哦,好的,我有十分特别的东西给你,我的小兔子.
Witch: oh yes, I have something very special for you, my little rabbit.

295
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:20,820
麦琪:我很高兴我在最近六个月里利用每个空闲时间来做这件衣服.我拍了张照片.跳,
Maggie: I'm so glad I took every spare moment of the last six months making

296
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:30,260
亲爱的,为妈妈跳,
that costume.I've got to get a snap shot.Hop honey, do it for mother.

297
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:40,300
再跳一个.小甜心.这几乎和去年的糖果一样多了
One more hop.Sweetheart.This is almost as much candy as last year.

298
00:18:40,300 --> 00:18:46,000
克莉丝:妈妈,我知道我愿意用这些糖果和你交换一个拥抱.
Chrissy: Mummy, you know I'd trade all this candy for a hug from you.

299
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:49,900
麦琪:哦,亲爱的,
Maggie: Oh honey, you don't have to trade a thing.

300
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:53,480
你不必交换这些.这是个温暖可爱的世界.
It's a beautiful warm, loving world.

301
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:56,200
现在别吃任何糖果,直到我们用X光照射之后.
Now don't eat any of this candy until we've had it x rayed.

302
00:18:56,200 --> 00:19:00,800
克莉丝:哦,我不吃.
Chrissy: Oh I won't.

303
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:04,740
麦琪:然后那个妈妈想,她是个什么类型的妈妈啊?
Maggie:(narrating) Then the mother thought, what kind of a mother was she?

304
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:06,300
她.
She's forgotten to kiss her daughter goodnight.

305
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:08,900
麦琪:我是什么类型的妈妈?
Maggie: What kind of a mother am I?

306
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:10,420
我忘记亲我的女儿晚安了.
I've forgotten to kiss my daughter goodnight.

307
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:27,200
克莉丝:你没有说关于苹果里面有保险丝.你救了我的命.
Chrissy: You didn't say anything about apples with fuses in them.You saved my life.

308
00:19:28,360 --> 00:19:32,800
麦琪:而且为什么它有危险?因为你没有听我说话.
Maggie: And why was it in danger?Because you didn't listen to me.

309
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:39,280
你知道,
You see, we mums should always be listened to.

310
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:44,020
总是要听我们妈妈说的话.因为当我们感觉到危险的时候,
Because when we have feelings of danger, you can bet we're right on the money.

311
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:47,380
你可以肯定在钱的问题上我们是对的.你就可以做自己喜欢的事,
You could do yourself a favor, as could all children,

312
00:19:47,380 --> 00:19:51,640
像其他孩子,如果你可以仅仅听听我要说的话.
if you could only some how hear what I have to say.

313
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:56,340
听从,
Listen to, respect and appreciate your mum.

314
00:19:58,380 --> 00:20:00,500
尊重和感激你的妈妈.她是唯一一个你会一直所拥有的.
She's the only one you'll ever have.

315
00:20:00,500 --> 00:20:03,600
克莉丝:阿门.
Chrissy: Amen.

316
00:20:04,220 --> 00:20:05,680
麦琪:结束了.
Maggie: The end.

317
00:20:11,460 --> 00:20:13,980
本:妈妈,
Ben: Mum, I'm starting to get an idea of why your writing career hasn't

318
00:20:13,980 --> 00:20:14,480
我开始明白你的写作生涯为什么没有结束了.
taken off.

319
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:17,040
杰森: 本,不要这么无礼.
Jason: Ben, don't be so rude.

320
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:20,380
你妈妈的故事是十分,故事有许多……(电话响了)我接电话.
Your mothers story was very, it had a lot...(phone rings) I'll get it.

321
00:20:21,460 --> 00:20:24,800
开萝尔:如果是我初次约会的取消电话,告诉他我不在.
Carol: If that's my blind date calling to cancel, tell him I'm not here.

322
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:25,500
杰森:你好.
Jason: Hello.

323
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:28,100
开萝尔:告诉他我和非常帅气的人外出了.
Carol: Tell him I'm out with somebody incredible good looking.

324
00:20:28,100 --> 00:20:28,300
杰森:是的.
Jason: Yeah.

325
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:31,700
开萝尔:告诉他我怜悯他,由于他错过了.
Carol: Tell him I pity him for what he's missed.

326
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:33,160
杰森:我会等你的电话的.
Jason: I'll be waiting for your call.

327
00:20:34,300 --> 00:20:35,500
开萝尔:什么?
Carol: Well?

328
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:36,760
杰森:不是你的电话.
Jason: It wasn't him

329
00:20:37,180 --> 00:20:40,820
开萝尔:我知道,就是他,爸爸.
Carol: I know it was dad.You don't have to lie to protect me.I'm ok.

330
00:20:41,460 --> 00:20:42,660
你不需要撒谎来保护我.我没事,我可以处理这些.
I can handle this.

331
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,440
杰森:我没有撒谎.
Jason: I'm not lying.

332
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:46,800
开萝尔:那么为什么你让我感觉这么心烦,爸爸?
Carol: Then why are you getting me so upset dad?

333
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:50,200
麦琪:那是谁,杰森?
Maggie: Who was it Jason?

334
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:54,060
杰森:没人.我说,
Jason: Nobody.Say, you know what would make this evening perfect?

335
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:56,300
你知道什么让今晚如此美好吗?厨房里有东西.
Something in the kitchen.

336
00:20:56,840 --> 00:20:57,900
麦琪:厨房里有东西!
Maggie: Something in the kitchen!

337
00:20:58,120 --> 00:21:01,040
杰森:下来,你的鸽子.过来.跟着我.
Jason: Get off your dove.Come on.And follow me.

338
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:04,460
麦琪:怎么回事?
Maggie: What's going on?

339
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,820
杰森:那是埃迪的电话.迈克应该在半小时前去接他,
Jason: That was Eddie on the phone.

340
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:08,560
但是他没有出现.
Mike was supposed to pick him up a half hour ago and he hasn't shown.

341
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:15,120
麦琪:他没出现?这样,也许我们应该打电话……哦,他已经找到黄眼睛了?
Maggie: He hasn't?Well maybe we should call...Hu.Has he got yellow eyes?

342
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,080
杰森:麦琪,我是认真的.00:21:15,600
Jason: Maggie, I'm serious.
